title: "OmniOS (agentdryrun Gateway): approvals, limits and a tamper-evident record for AI agents"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "ntinosgkiou-code"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ntinosgkiou-code/omnios"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
abstract: >-
  A gateway between an AI agent and the systems it acts on: rules, limits and four-eyes approvals, a signed append-only log per
  customer, and evidence packs that a third party verifies offline. Source-available prototype; never run with a real agent,
  bank or customer.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - approvals
  - audit-trail
  - transparency-log
  - evidence
